  "releaseNotes": "Fix false TEDAPI solar-production dips during brief SolarMeterComms dropouts. Use complete configured remote-meter samples within 60 seconds of gateway time, correct load power by the same delta and expose nullable held-power age. Preserve raw telemetry, measured currents, energy counters, existing signatures, runtime dependencies and assembly identity. See RELEASE-NOTES.md.",
